# Shang-Chi and the Ten Rings: "Whenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Shang-Chi. When the tenth +1/+1 counter
# is put on Shang-Chi, you draw five cards and gain 5 life." Each of Bot1's draws puts a counter on it: one on turn 3, one on
# turn 5, and seven from Wheel of Fortune on turn 5 - nine, and nothing more happens (Bot2's seven draws are not Bot1's).
# The turn-7 draw puts the tenth on it (CR 122.6, 603.2): Bot1 draws five more cards, each another counter (no second
# tenth), and gains 5 life. Shang-Chi ends with fifteen counters, a 17/17 with first strike.

